      "text": "ALL 13 PROGRAM PAGES \u2014 every word is the client's own, taken verbatim from their live site. Nothing was rewritten.\n\nEach page's class times are generated from data/classes.json by program tag, not typed in. Change a boxing class once and it moves on the boxing page AND the master schedule. Adult pages exclude kids classes; the kids pages carry their own.\n\nPersonal Training shows no schedule on purpose \u2014 it is by appointment. Kids Martial Arts is the umbrella page, so it lists every kids class.\n\nStill coming: coaches, FAQ, then Events (GoHighLevel embed) and Sponsors as two separate pages."
